<translate>
==== UseWorldItem ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
When this param is true, after placing item on ground will be used world texture sprite. (from "media/inventory/world/WItem_####.png")
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
UseWorldItem = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

